Reproduce the behavior of these statements:
const arr = [3000, 19, 13];
const total = arr.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);
console.log(total);
In this run, what total does reduce print?

Trace the following program to see what it writes:
const arr = [3001, 7, 3];
